  "label": "Kevin Hart is mapped as 'obedience'",
  "description": "The top text 'obedience' is mapped onto Kevin Hart, implying that he embodies or represents the concept of 'obedience' as described in the meme's derogatory context. This mapping is based on the juxtaposition of his earnest, engaged expression with the text, which frames his public persona as a symbol of the stereotype being mocked — specifically, the idea that people who don't smile are 'obedient' or passive. The meme uses his image to project this negative concept onto him, even though he is not literally 'obedient' in the context of the image.",
